# sdist file set (H26).
#
# The sdist must carry everything the build needs, because `pip install
# --no-binary :all:` rebuilds from it. The three files below are named
# explicitly rather than left to setuptools' defaults so the guarantee is
# stated, not inherited. The prunes keep the wheel and the sdist free of the
# directories the old `find_packages(exclude=...)` kept out.

include README.md
include LICENSE
include pyproject.toml

prune tests
prune docs
prune local_development
